  Hypothesis Rtp : ltac2:(zQ "80!j7!mn2!hi4!mn7!mnf!mo4!hg6!lb@3$2@1$7@1$0#k0@2$3?1R@3$4@1$0#5+4Kv$1@2$5@1$0#5+4@2$6@1$0#k0+hgrmr8").
